message: "Please cite this repository and acknowledge the upstream sources for any imported subsets used."
title: "MCP Benchmark 1.0: Dataset and Harness + LLM Construction Method"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "yongqicui555"
version: "1.0.0-rc.1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yongqicui555/mcp_benchmark_1.0"
url: "https://github.com/yongqicui555/mcp_benchmark_1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An MCP security benchmark comprising 1025 labeled samples, including
  340 imported benign samples and 685 samples constructed across five
  application bases. The accompanying harness + LLM method combines
  controlled construction and testing with Codex and behavioral
  transformation with GLM-5.2 within Hermes. Final code is released as
  an implementation artifact of the staged workflow with manual approval.
